hough he made a hobby of collecting fragrances. But when, as a lark, he published a collection of his reviews of the world's perfumes, the book hit the small, insular business of perfume makers like a thunderclap. Who is this man Luca Turin, they demanded, and how does he know so much? The closed community of scent creation opened up to Luca Turin, and he discovered a fact that astonished him: no one in this world knew how smell worked. Billions and billions of dollars were spent creating scents in a manner amounting to glorified trial and error.The solution to the mystery of every other human sense has led to the Nobel Prize, if not vast riches. Why, Luca Turin thought, should smell be any different? So he gave his life to this great puzzle. And in the end, incredibly, it would seem that he solved it.","publicationYear":2002,"subjectCategories":[{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Smell","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-the-emperor-of-scent-a-story-of-perfume-obsession-and-the-last-mystery-of-the-senses-chandler-bu"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Biophysicists","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-the-emperor-of-scent-a-story-of-perfume-obsession-and-the-last-mystery-of-the-senses-chandler-bu"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Nose","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-the-emperor-of-scent-a-story-of-perfume-obsession-and-the-last-mystery-of-the-senses-chandler-bu"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Biography","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-the-emperor-of-scent-a-story-of-perfume-obsession-and-the-last-mystery-of-the-senses-chandler-bu"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Perfumes industry","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-the-emperor-of-scent-a-story-of-perfume-obsession-and-the-last-mystery-of-the-senses-chandler-bu"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","